// The explicit, complete list of differences an upgrade is ALLOWED to make to a document, as the API serves it (tests/upgrade-fixtures/README.md).
// An upgrade test compares every document, canonicalised, with what the build that wrote the fixture served. Any difference that is not
// matched by an entry here fails the test and names the member that changed. An entry is a JSON pointer in which `*` stands for one
// segment, with the reason and the release that introduced it. Adding an entry is a decision that old documents change on upgrade;
// it belongs in the CHANGELOG's breaking-changes section too (docs/upgrade-backup.md, "What a patch may and may not change").
//
// Empty: no upgrade from any fixture changes a document's content.
[]
